# Read by ripgrep, which is what Claude Code's Grep and Glob run on: a repo-wide search skips
# these generated blobs instead of returning thousands of matching lines from them. Naming one
# by its exact path still searches it. .gitignore already covers the caches and dist folders.
# Root CLAUDE.md's "Generated files" table says what each one is.
seedProfiles.js
public/facts/pack-*.json
package-lock.json
playtest/fixtures/profiles.json
